        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: NASA Astronaut Group 15\n- Concepts: The Flying Escargot\n- Places: France\n- Products: Pretty Woman\n- People: Garry Marshall, J. F. Lawton\n\nFacts:\n- Pretty Woman is a 1990 American romantic comedy film.\n- Pretty Woman was directed by Garry Marshall.\n- Pretty Woman was written by J. F. Lawton.\n- Members of NASA Astronaut Group 15 adopted \"The Flying Escargot\" as their moniker.\n- One possible reference for \"The Flying Escargot\" was that two members of NASA Astronaut Group 15 were from France.\n- Another possible reference for \"The Flying Escargot\" was the famous \"flying escargot\" scene in Pretty Woman.",
